  "question": {
    "text": "If the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, is a directrix of the hyperbola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, then the hyperbola passes through the point",
