  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given equation of hyperbola is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Equation of directrix will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac></math>,</p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is the equation of directrix</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;is rejected</p><p>So equation of hyperbola will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy the given hyperbola</p></blockquote>",
